config TRUSTONIC_MOBICORE
	tristate "Trustonic t-base (MobiCore) normal-world driver"
	depends on ARM64 && OF
	help
	  Driver for the Trustonic t-base 302A secure OS on Exynos 7420.
	  It provides /dev/mobicore and /dev/mobicore-user for McDaemon,
	  which Samsung's keymaster and gatekeeper HALs depend on.
